# Files exempt from the "no upstream hosts" CI guard.
# gitignore-style path globs; one per line. Only tooling that intentionally
# references the upstream host to REWRITE it, migration provenance, and human
# documentation belong here. Application/runtime code must never be hand-added.

# Documentation legitimately names the upstream project and its hosts.
**/*.md
**/*.mdx

# Migration/rewrite tooling: this shim DETECTS legacy upstream extension URLs
# (penguinmod.site / penguinmod.com) at load time and rewrites them to
# patternyard.dev. It must reference the upstream host literally to match it.
src/extension-support/extension-manager.js
